Open Router1 → **CLI** tab, press Enter, then paste this:

```
enable
configure terminal
interface g0/0
 ip address 10.0.1.2 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
interface g0/1
 ip address 10.0.2.1 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
exit
router ospf 1
 network 10.0.1.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 10.0.2.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
end
write memory
```

Check with `show ip interface brief`. The R0–R1 link should turn up/up now, since Router0 is already configured. Then do Router3 and Router2.
